    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own single-celled organism and dive into a vast microscopic world. Eat, fight, and unlock upgrades to survive the dangerous microcosm. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the shape and look of your cell, drag and drop attachments which impacts your stats and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated worlds, featuring diverse biomes with unique characteristics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed</strong> - Progress is always saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal</strong> - Progress is only saved if you reach a checkpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore</strong> - If you die, you die forever.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own single-celled organism and dive into a vast microscopic world. Eat, fight, and unlock upgrades to survive the dangerous microcosm. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the shape and look of your cell, drag and drop attachments which impacts your stats and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated worlds, featuring diverse biomes with unique characteristics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed</strong> - Progress is always saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal</strong> - Progress is only saved if you reach a checkpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore</strong> - If you die, you die forever.</p></li></ul>",
